# Chrome Web Store / Edge Add-ons packaging output.
# Ignore everything in dist/ EXCEPT the signed .crx so that users can
# install Caliper without going through the store. The .pem (private
# signing key) MUST stay ignored — it lives only on the maintainer's
# machine; leaking it would let an attacker publish forged updates
# under the same extension ID.
dist/*
!dist/*.crx

# Local submission notes (not shipped, not pushed)
STORE_SUBMISSION.md
